# V120: research/v40/tape.py's ride for the original (research/c15/tape.py makes the .p2m2 from it):
# gas 75 ticks with the bars at 200, the brake 60, idle 60, then the brake held 90 so the bike stands
# still for the shot (tape.py OUT 75 200 90 is the shell's side)
down cross
stick l 0.5703125 0
sleep 75t
up cross
stick l 0 0
down square
sleep 60t
up square
sleep 60t
down square
sleep 90t
